<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  Industrial inspection site — the environment where legs beat wheels.

  Everything here is a thing a wheeled robot cannot do: stairs, a debris field,
  a raised catwalk, a pipe to step over. The greenhouse is flat on purpose;
  this is not. Primitives only, so it loads offline like the others.
-->
